  "query": "-- The newest version of one kind of a saved match's documents, the one the page shows.\n-- ?1 the match, ?2 the kind (application, resume).\nSELECT id, text, written_at\nFROM documents\nWHERE cv_match_id = ?1 AND kind = ?2\nORDER BY written_at DESC, id DESC\nLIMIT 1\n",
